l as other titles including Crimson Annihilator or Bloody Duchess. She was entranced by the young Phoron's singing voice and thus decided to make a pact with him so he would be hers and hers only."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39745"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c0cd622050fa38c5800494f947ce1c7b3ca71d567de696890099a397eeada10.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24964bc13c45c93c93468e639e5e5d28908b1e478d7c5fee6ebff37962d20813.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平井 理子","creatorId":"vndb:s102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s102","name":"平井 理子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:37657","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39746","characterName":"ツゲ・ユフィンリー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39746"},"originalCharacterName":"ツゲ・ユフィンリー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The boss of the Tsuge Divine Music Player Office. She plays a violin-like instrument and is very strict. She has a contract with two spirits, Yardio and Mashat, the latter of whom is seldom seen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39746"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f23508a5c576901be73057a015f2eac606576b118dd84e58a090db8929888e07.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/chara